    {
      "source": "Value class tying together a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterRegistration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterRegistration</code></a> and its <a href=\"CustomConversions.ConverterRegistrationIntent.ConverterOrigin.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>origin</code></a> to allow\nfine-grained registration based on store supported types.",
      "translation": "Value 类将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterRegistration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterRegistration</code></a> 及其 <a href=\"CustomConversions.ConverterRegistrationIntent.ConverterOrigin.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>origin</code></a> 绑定在一起，以支持基于存储支持的类型进行细粒度的注册。",
      "count": 1
    },
